      "content": "I'm sorry to hear you're feeling stressed, but your concerns seem grounded. Consistently disregarding your dietary needs, delaying payroll, and rescheduling meetings can indeed feel disruptive and may be frustrating. It might be worth discussing directly with your manager or HR to address these issues and see if there are underlying reasons behind these changes. Your well-being is important, and sometimes a direct conversation can help clarify any misunderstandings and lead to a more positive outcome.",
